      "proposed_content": "The source composes three representation changes: zeta completion produces an entire xi symbol encoded by a Hadamard product over nontrivial zeros, flat Fourier functional calculus turns that symbol into a nonlocal wave operator, and a regularized partial-factor construction formally rewrites the quadratic form as a sum of zero-indexed local Klein-Gordon factors.",
